    ourServiceText1: 'Isevisi ikuvumela ukuba uthole, wabelane futhi wenze imali ngokuqukethwe endaweni ehlukaniswe ngokuphelele, inikeza isithangami sokuba abantu baxhumane, bazise, futhi bagqugquzele abanye emhlabeni wonke, futhi isebenza njengenkundla yokusabalalisa yabasunguli bokuqala bokuqukethwe ngaphandle kwemingcele ehlanganisiwe. Sinikeza ipulatifomu emelana nokuhlolelwa lapho noma ubani angenza khona imali ngokuqukethwe kwakhe ngokubusa komphakathi kunokulawulwa kwezinkampani.',
    ourServiceText2: 'I-DeHub isebenza njengephrothokholi ehlukanisiwe lapho ukulinganisela okusunguliwe kusingathwa ukuphathwa komphakathi, ukuqinisekisa ukuthi okusunguliwe okungekho emthethweni kuphela noma okusunguliwe okwephula iziqondiso ezigunyazwe umphakathi kungavinjelwa.',
    softwareDevelopers: 'Ubani Osebenzisa i-DeHub',
    softwareDevText1: 'I-DeHub iyi-Dao ezimele. Ayikho inkampani engumnikazi, esebenza noma elawula Isevisi. Iphrothokholi, ipulatifomu nomgcinimafa kulawulwa abanikazi bamathokheni e-DeHub ngokusebenzisa iphrothokholi yokubusa ye-DeHub, ebukhoma: iziphakamiso ziyaphakanyiswa futhi zivotelwe ku-app, futhi umphumela ubopha uhlelo lwezinto eziphilayo. Kulesi Sivumelwano "DeHub", "thina", "thina" nelithi "yethu" kusho i-DAO nenqubo eyiphethe, hhayi inkampani.',
    softwareDevText2: 'Ukuthuthukiswa kwenziwa abanikeli abazimele kanye nezitudiyo ezibandakanyeka YI-DAO. Akekho kubo ongumnikazi wesimiso semvelo se-DeHub noma onamandla okuthatha izinqumo kuso, futhi noma iyiphi yazo ingathathelwa indawo noma isuswe ngevoti lokubusa. Akekho ongashintsha iphrothokholi, ithokheni noma le Migomo ngaphandle kwaleyo nqubo.',
    whoMayUse: 'Ubani Ongasebenzisa Isevisi?',
    ageRequirements: 'Izimfuneko Zobudala',
    ageRequirementsText: 'Ungasebenzisa Isevisi kuphela uma okungenani uneminyaka engu-16 ubudala.',
