    intro: 'I-DeHub iyipulatifomu ehlukanisiwe, ephethwe ngumsebenzisi, kodwa akuyona indawo engenayo imithetho. Lezi ziqondiso zichaza lokho okuvunyelwe nokungavunyelwe, indlela yokubika okusunguliwe, nokuthi kwenzekani ngemva kokuba umbiko wenziwe. Inqubomgomo isethwe ukuphathwa komphakathi; ukuphoqelelwa kwenziwa ngokushesha ngabaphathi abaqokiwe.',
    notAllowed: 'Okungavunyelwe',
    notAllowedText: 'Okuqukethwe nokuziphatha okulandelayo akuvunyelwe noma kuphi ku-DeHub, okuhlanganisa amaphosti, amakhomenti, ukusakaza, imiyalezo, amaphrofayili namagama abasebenzisi:',
